akes the statement unknown.\n   - The only piece of information that could make the statement unknown is if there is a contradiction or missing information that would make Dave not nice, but there is no such information provided.\n\nTherefore, based on the given context and rules, the statement \"Dave is nice\" is consistent and does not contradict any information provided. Hence, the statement is true.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) Unknown\n</answer>",
